  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "29",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Solving we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tantan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>29</mn></math></p>",
